{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:86b94d834d6a3435e0e5c165a03581efe7c5244b785c0af4008074b3c52a88d9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11580911dcf0efef2561b87ffa6d19e8570a5b3c07f94f2a65d408e8ca3db0fb",
      "text": "道流和制作人正为武的生日派对做准备，\n而涟却在一旁无所事事。\n他们借由慰问便当探查武的口味偏好，推进筹备。\n生日派对能否顺利举行呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a643f0a6f483c15f20f9aa770cb74cb73f8789c65bb14cb4e80838d3de994f8",
      "text": "那么今天也赶紧开始商量\n武的生日派对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dff2fcbac3c7d4adc1eda94b6ee41c18614e12b00ee6ba29907a98809148bfc",
      "text": "师父，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af7d5e7fe4aa5c59dc73749c4d7113af16d8ed561bc1a6f4473b1150f0442ee0",
      "text": "好的。首先确认一下上次为止的内容，\n当天由我去蛋糕店取蛋糕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e488eac7f533519a9dd10aacd1e92d52bf1898a05c3ee1343c4ee06c598e95",
      "text": "在那期间，由道流先生负责准备料理对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea662746b4022d83a37b1356a2bf76e0d566bc0e4c8b0cdd5e447ba1fe46ef1",
      "text": "是的！要做什么我也已经定好了。\n主菜是炸物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b33325ef36bac2e5108babd0e4534b06b15f65de0c7e4141978df5611bce1df9",
      "text": "虽然大部分会在我家提前做好，\n但炸物果然还是现炸的才好吃嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc4c81b65afb3bcfdaffcd9d8377b6d8329941daf858825454da5574f1c1cb4",
      "text": "因为我想让武在最好吃的瞬间吃上。\n当然，师父你们也是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28f54458231e0880fc6dfedcf36bf4b2c8a3381ad7a41babea5126fffe78fd49",
      "text": "我也很期待道流先生的料理。\n如果还需要其他什么东西，请尽管说哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c06d8a499e5c7580f9b4d310ce18575c5e15b3466fc52b07dcbb5ed3d6e6ce8",
      "text": "嗯——……呼啊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d0ced6dbf8ff38f9e66c3533a2a36a3de950a471b19c9d2e5961b884780f780",
      "text": "早啊，涟。你也来参加\n武的生日派对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5298a7136d8d514a4ca50244403786549047b94fec4ef23ca5cfad54515b0519",
      "text": "啊？本大爷凭什么要参加那种玩意儿。\n又没有给小不点庆祝的义务。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:483fe6ed189d51a261593375d78e7e70f1f4f962bc1748a4677109ecd88ee515",
      "text": "好啦好啦别这么说。当天会准备\n很多丰盛大餐的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72041e41d743c10dceb9cc65cb365675ad14474537f7108d22a2a337ece6463c",
      "text": "而且，到了涟生日的时候我也会做你喜欢吃的东西哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9398ce6bf9d6fb8a0b3d40eb10023e8bf2ad442f72f26ab97ad6fc5fbb0eb49",
      "text": "本大爷以外的人过生日根本无所谓……但这次\n算例外的。小不点那份我也要吃光！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfe0c179136b76155f10d1706593742eecb2f3d4828b1090e136fa0116c6ab02",
      "text": "请给主角武先生留一份哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b8d7eb1f68840662f60e647deea0a8d3f4c0cee24ed65fec4a874c735990992",
      "text": "我会做到吃都吃不完的程度，没问题的！\n就放心地交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e558480a6fbd69cfe5a233766c961b2e750b33b6cfe0cce5115ab6ad50a67216",
      "text": "圆城寺先生，便当谢了。\n今天的也很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c55ac970b995c39dc96dd1f87d2468354a3713a38d8f477da1b9a752f1efd5a7",
      "text": "招待不周。你能这么说我真高兴。\n话说……今天的菜里有你喜欢的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c58463cde68fd743957fdbf64ba04dc6978ca155bddd904d68e5c17203be307c",
      "text": "喜欢的配菜？\n……炸鸡块吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b8c0b00078e9bbd5098b654c9bad60dc8cd119cb9ef8f0e2e0b6093eaee623",
      "text": "哦哦，那太好了。\n我今天特意放了比平时更多的生姜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201a13e03454ad85d23d7bf48e27a77413694bac70ead80a5b472634c1700567",
      "text": "这样啊。\n另外，可乐饼的调味也挺不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:424d4f347e0f753d558445eeedc57bc8f84750c8d01a6f832b35b217d574b92c",
      "text": "这样啊，那个我也记下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0f5256e51978f1a5bb0c3efb9c4adb179a34a16c6dc84c61ee53897f98a38f8",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……吧唧吧唧……\n喂拉面店的，再给我来一份！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68b74c224911795e2fbff5d185ff20494dec859b82a8c35e6a620483ba0fe6f",
      "text": "哈哈，把我的分给你吧。\n多吃点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfcb6d4f4fc95aeeb698b5c3329cfa7c532b3b3a9061713d803f7fae734d9a60",
      "text": "圆城寺先生，能给我们做便当虽然很感激，\n但每天都做不会很辛苦吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe8ff9d9cad978850afcccea67e67bb993a2bde591672e718ac6938204e695db",
      "text": "不会，能收到感想反而是帮了我大忙。\n我现在正在研究料理呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15a2ce7e32090906b46a044a7b79d47ed238fe15e9352ca6ec3b2b6c73c72955",
      "text": "是吗？那就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e59ea5e9bd34f6cde7aaa1641ae369a48cc3341be74300c08ddb1bf8df942aff",
      "text": "……好！接下来只要炸好炸鸡块，\n派对的准备就万无一失了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7839419c88c8c16bf01e0acdf16e868b22c009e3fb0c0fdaa5e09f15cf0b97f",
      "text": "备料都在家里弄好了。腌了一整晚的酱汁，\n味道应该也很入味了才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66a84cf76a6fa7b9434351c22b1ef9f8bc7f067432fbdea57e2acccdb5d289c2",
      "text": "这就下锅炸咯——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fd40e59cc46273814b0613b1e242ee1844281075e9868c4f2f6f96d93653019",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……吧唧吧唧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71022bcec3036fef314ac435db7d54d43d1ef3d1f65c21fbd619903babe39a5",
      "text": "偷吃适可而止啊。\n等下丰盛的大餐就吃不下了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79e678ed7570cd8fb870f0726548605ce6be40ae0ef32ad0a1bb391c5b49ee9a",
      "text": "库哈哈！就这么一点怎么可能填饱\n本大爷的肚子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f950ac42b3ac90e35870bd562cfef2d2eb1953d4a0f1de5d488e67683906169b",
      "text": "来，再给你一个大的。\n离派对开始还要再等一下哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39470937089d37ec8b2fee96d453d13ec7f28263e60095dc69a3b5a2ca06be09",
      "text": "啧。真抠门。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f420a85572e47e8868bd7d600b30721ca50c9516f3fea0ce21681edf11a4ea8b",
      "text": "距离和武约好的时间……\n还有一会儿。照这个势头继续炸吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a78db3a6e699959d2532b72f8b5ceed3f2bc5be4d2701ae520e3902d77c38bf",
      "text": "去拿蛋糕的师父\n应该也差不多该回来了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de6f8bbf689729da43c031355d8f248a3837f0673dc38a056a84e719c26373c0",
      "text": "（来得挺早的啊……\n离跟圆城寺先生约好的时间还有一会儿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731045c7c571d3120e77f1b242777b1c1a6e9ae8271756e53c93c4a191a3b8d6",
      "text": "（去事务所里等吧。\n……那是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb0b8086ee1db4e7fdc50e239595dd2d93d9c6ed7b54bd6ba44a1893c967c5ce",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af4fc0fe6225f331bdc2524b8a5e163505312c347e9af039733d2f889e2f35e8",
      "text": "武、武先生！辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5db462d6b54237915a681ea11b47219b304d874b41a833e917ccac41c6a6d3b",
      "text": "……？\n制作人也是要去事务所吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afbaef5c9d631f77b3b96f9ea250388bb41135a725f061eb505e8344dab40162",
      "text": "是的。我正好办完事回来。\n武先生也是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b3f54edd535fa0e67900750fdec59be780048eb18e8b4b3d642f6cfb07c8c7",
      "text": "嗯。圆城寺先生叫我过来的。\n说是到了事务所再跟我说具体是什么事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aafcb3aba93f1b826ba538324e5f4c625df4857a03061ffde45914b8e382476",
      "text": "你听说什么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:931c5638b8ad6ea443ca0835b043b500d8df96336e82c9a16902e36811a914dd",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n我什么都没……啊，不好意思稍等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61fdb55ded45f83c618bb1e8a56acb991ea287067514db7ff71ecfff8259b584",
      "text": "哦，师父发LINK来了。我瞧瞧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84ac8d3ef163d8f956f29d89419833776d7737ee8cd41c1948a0f94a98b94e4c",
      "text": "……“武先生已经到附近了，\n我稍微拖延一下时间”吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a37cc913c3dbcd20474c93d449b33c3c4f2e3f88de397b129c9a267970413a4f",
      "text": "那可帮大忙了！趁着师父拖延时间的\n空当，我再把炸鸡块复炸一遍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28f700f2e64d6f65b24a2fe4ffff8bc8cc1511c97552da408b298b2f76837a24",
      "text": "（这样暂时就没问题了。\n蛋糕的保冷剂也还能撑一阵子……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe67454c24b3578eb216bfe9c6a1ae74bb075b3c4509664c41bdbf43dc383396",
      "text": "让您久等了。武先生，如果时间方便的话，\n去事务所之前要不要一起在这附近散散步？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e113172e48cc0892dc38094b7af1b790b591f5835b34d6a55a0723e98001073",
      "text": "我无所谓。正好在犯愁怎么打发时间，\n来得正好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b261eea74c3ed888783d3a68a707e4c9a772d1b839f56ab396d50be8ba8d555c",
      "text": "辛苦。刚才在那边碰上了制作人……\n嗯？好香的味道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b48795d7f48b017fe8eec41ba464f209df00b2685ed4dd3567c79286afac81",
      "text": "武，师父！正好。\n我这边刚好准备完毕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb3121118e99793ea6bfef667444e82c8b1b94e3b91741d9f92db31d8a4c8425",
      "text": "准备？\n……圆城寺先生，这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c532abc7826e4ee4b9d204fb5bd336a2d63228956e5269022f8d5074140db61e",
      "text": "生日快乐，武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da456d601f399002a61941d5e3bb05a6517b5fbbc92d54932f477e408f66b47e",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5e75053e9d6223126745c16bce82bfe3cdf23902666dd8f97829c65c19044e",
      "text": "放上师父带回来的蛋糕……\n好嘞。这样就完美了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8788c3ff4c2bd2d12602c515fc989809a1fb7a4daa3697fc567deb54e286162",
      "text": "这是，我的生日派对吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f72854ebc0edfd82d40c63d3e81bb1db3c51041ac84609d63a6e376336a55ee",
      "text": "那当然。特意为了武准备的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea55697a099a430f6987f89a6ba625b4d427093ca60dc3b750e28491eafaab3b",
      "text": "这样啊……不仅有蛋糕，连炸鸡块和\n拉面都准备了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1282faa7b20b4c108221637b2fdd976f5c6b9ad4bc2abc0175fbf3fc8e22642",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……尽管好好感谢本大爷吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a356b4262e1877db925886ba0c04e0935ba55d6c8891faa4b74f0b731a209cec",
      "text": "你做什么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2a7c1653acf992d43a5e828fcb1418eb68a35a78c699adb8395aea426c252b4",
      "text": "涟也帮忙端盘子了哦！\n好啦，趁菜变凉之前快吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3649d6de0313a0eed4017855f78efde63a1d5897c77418d8db13e3fe1241c88",
      "text": "制作人也是，圆城寺先生也是，谢谢你们。\n……姑且也跟你道个谢吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7522aef52d45ef1f3690156a95079ccfda93502121b894813a2fe87a63bb1b91",
      "text": "哼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c75187044eb6a569a1e7207639e2e611404459ea476397fcbe477569f83e056",
      "text": "大家的心意，我心领了。\n再次谢谢大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
